 ```
 
+### `frame-callback-rate-unfocused`
+
+Cap the rate, in Hz, at which visible but unfocused windows receive frame callbacks.
+Clients that draw on frame callbacks, like terminals with spinners, then render at most this often while the focused window and the output stay at full rate.
+`0`, the default, disables the cap.
+
+```kdl
+frame-callback-rate-unfocused 60
+```
+
 ### `environment`
 
 Override environment variables for processes spawned by niri.
